  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic. In a medium saucepan, heat the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Add jasmine rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt, stir, then bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat and keep covered until the rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f844270d0527cba53a9c82/step-fa942500.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the rice is cooking, roughly chop Asian greens. Trim green beans, cut into thirds. Cut Malaysian tofu into 2cm chunks.\n• In a medium bowl, combine cornflour, the cracked black pepper and sweet soy seasoning. Add tofu, tossing to coat.\n• In a small bowl, combine soy sauce mix, the honey, ginger paste and a splash of water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f844270d0527cba53a9c82/step-e48a4310.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook green beans, stirring, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• In the last 2 minutes of cook time, add Asian greens and cook, tossing, until fragrant and wilted, 1-2 minutes.\n• Transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f844270d0527cba53a9c82/step-c47ecc20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook tofu, tossing until browned, 3-4 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f844270d0527cba53a9c82/step-c7e85230.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return green beans and Asian greens to the pan.\n• Add soy-ginger mixture and cook, tossing to coat, until heated through, 30 seconds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f844270d0527cba53a9c82/step-bd294340.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rice between bowls.\n• Top with sweet soy tofu and Asian greens stir-fry, spooning over any remaining soy-ginger sauce from the pan to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f844270d0527cba53a9c82/step-81e6a550.jpg"
    }
  ]
